For Swap Nodes in Pairs, the mental template is:

dummy → first → second → remaining

              ↓

dummy → second → first → remaining
Remember

Don't move the values. Move the links.

first.next  = second.next
second.next = first
prev.next   = second

That gives O(n) time + O(1) space, which is the optimal solution.
